T*
(1. On-call basics) Tj
T*
(Every service has a primary and a secondary on-call engineer. The primary) Tj
T*
(acknowledges a page within five minutes and opens an incident channel; the) Tj
T*
(secondary takes over if there is no acknowledgement after fifteen minutes.) Tj
T*
(Handover happens every Monday at 10:00 and is recorded in the rota.) Tj
T*
