(3. Postmortems) Tj
T*
(A postmortem is written for every SEV1 and SEV2 incident within five work-) Tj
T*
(ing days. It is blameless: it describes what the system allowed to happen,) Tj
T*
(not who made a mistake. Action items get an owner and a due date.) Tj
T*
